ntinuous variables, respectively.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"VE against MIS-C was calculated by comparing the odds of full COVID-19 vaccination among MIS-C case-patients and controls\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sensitivity analyses were conducted to evaluate VE against MIS-C among patients with serologic evidence of previous infection\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 3\", \"q\": \"Firth penalized regression was used for models with six or fewer vaccinated cases.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}